{
    "title": "Belk \u2013 Shopping App",
    "description": "Reimagine department store shopping with the Belk app: your source for shopping, rewards, and deals on everything from men\u2019s and women\u2019s fashion to home goods. Browse thousands of styles, see offers and coupons, and pick out that perfect something today, all from the comfort of your phone!\u00a0\r\nThe Belk app offers a wide variety of fits, sizes and styles in every category \u2014 from men\u2019s, women\u2019s and kids\u2019 clothing and shoes to handbags and other accessories. Plus, shop a wide selection of designer fashion, cosmetics and fragrance. You can even save your favorite products to purchase later. Please leave us a review and let us know about your experience! Brands You Love Shop the newest men\u2019s and women\u2019s fashion, shoes and accessories from brands and designers like:\u00a0\r\n\u00b7 Levi\u2019s\r\n\u00b7 Polo Ralph Lauren\u00a0\r\n\u00b7 Michael Kors\u00a0\r\n\u00b7 Free People\u00a0\r\n\u00b7 Vans\u00a0\r\n\u00b7 Tommy Hilfiger\u00a0\r\n\u00b7 Vince Camuto\u00a0\r\n\u00b7 UGG\u00ae\u00a0\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ll also find designer watches and other accessories from brands like Movado, Bulova & Skagen and the best in beauty from Est\u00e9e Lauder, Clinique and more.\u00a0\r\n\r\nNever Miss a Deal\u00a0\r\nGet push notifications on your phone and be the first to know about great deals, offers and our latest coupons. You can earn and redeem Belk Bucks when you shop in the app, too!\r\n\r\nManage Your Rewards\u00a0\r\nManage your Belk Rewards credit card account easily from the app. Plus, see how many Belk Reward Dollars you have available to spend and apply them at checkout for savings you\u2019ll love.\u00a0\r\n\r\nQuick & Easy Checkout\u00a0\r\nWe\u2019ll save your checkout information, so all you have to do is enter your security code to complete your purchase. You can also pay with PayPal!\u00a0\r\n\r\nFree Store Pickup\u00a0\r\nIf you have to have it today, you can! Shop in the app, add products to your bag and choose the \u201cFree Store Pickup\u201d option for eligible items. Your purchase will be available at your local store within a few hours \u2014 for free, of course!\u00a0\r\n\r\nEffortless Gifting\u00a0\r\nCheck out our Gift Guide to shop department store gifts by recipient, interest, occasion and more! We\u2019ve picked out the most-wanted products for everyone on your list and every event on your calendar.\r\n\r\nRegistry Love\u00a0\r\nCreate and manage your wedding registry easily inside the Belk app. Browse and add items from your favorite home brands, or scan and add items to your registry right from your smart phone. You can also maintain multiple registries and quickly update your gift list.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Reimagine department store shopping with the Belk app: your source for shopping, rewards, and deals on everything from men\u2019s and women\u2019s fashion to home goods. Browse thousands of styles, see offers and coupons, and pick out that perfect something today, all from the comfort of your phone!\u00a0<br>The Belk app offers a wide variety of fits, sizes and styles in every category \u2014 from men\u2019s, women\u2019s and kids\u2019 clothing and shoes to handbags and other accessories. Plus, shop a wide selection of designer fashion, cosmetics and fragrance. You can even save your favorite products to purchase later. Please leave us a review and let us know about your experience! Brands You Love Shop the newest men\u2019s and women\u2019s fashion, shoes and accessories from brands and designers like:\u00a0<br>\u00b7 Levi\u2019s<br>\u00b7 Polo Ralph Lauren\u00a0<br>\u00b7 Michael Kors\u00a0<br>\u00b7 Free People\u00a0<br>\u00b7 Vans\u00a0<br>\u00b7 Tommy Hilfiger\u00a0<br>\u00b7 Vince Camuto\u00a0<br>\u00b7 UGG\u00ae\u00a0<br><br>You\u2019ll also find designer watches and other accessories from brands like Movado, Bulova &amp; Skagen and the best in beauty from Est\u00e9e Lauder, Clinique and more.\u00a0<br><br>Never Miss a Deal\u00a0<br>Get push notifications on your phone and be the first to know about great deals, offers and our latest coupons. You can earn and redeem Belk Bucks when you shop in the app, too!<br><br>Manage Your Rewards\u00a0<br>Manage your Belk Rewards credit card account easily from the app. Plus, see how many Belk Reward Dollars you have available to spend and apply them at checkout for savings you\u2019ll love.\u00a0<br><br>Quick &amp; Easy Checkout\u00a0<br>We\u2019ll save your checkout information, so all you have to do is enter your security code to complete your purchase. You can also pay with PayPal!\u00a0<br><br>Free Store Pickup\u00a0<br>If you have to have it today, you can! Shop in the app, add products to your bag and choose the \u201cFree Store Pickup\u201d option for eligible items. Your purchase will be available at your local store within a few hours \u2014 for free, of course!\u00a0<br><br>Effortless Gifting\u00a0<br>Check out our Gift Guide to shop department store gifts by recipient, interest, occasion and more! We\u2019ve picked out the most-wanted products for everyone on your list and every event on your calendar.<br><br>Registry Love\u00a0<br>Create and manage your wedding registry easily inside the Belk app. Browse and add items from your favorite home brands, or scan and add items to your registry right from your smart phone. You can also maintain multiple registries and quickly update your gift list.",
